{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>And you shall visit your dwelling</b> — You shall find it as you intended, and you shall not fail." "<b>And you shall come to the grave</b> — It has no parallel except twice in this book. Its meaning: that one shall die when one's full number of days is completed, and that is old age."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:01:57.249509239Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}